    <text>
        <body>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_4f5aecd5">
            <head><hi rendition="#c #b #i"><hi rendition="#larger"><lb /><orgName corresp="welte.studios"><hi rendition="#smaller"><hi rendition="#smaller #uu">The</hi></hi> Welte-Mignon Studios</orgName></hi></hi></head>
            <ab><hi rendition="#c #b #i">
            <lb />
            <address>
               <addrLine>667 Fifth Avenue-at 53rd Street</addrLine>
            </address>
            </hi></ab>
        </div>
        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_b669256d">
            <ab><hi rendition="#c #b">
            <lb />A really <hi rendition="#u">satisfactory</hi> way
            <lb />to buy musical instruments</hi></ab></div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_cd8eef02">
            <ab><lb /><hi rendition="#dropcap #i">A</hi> FEELING of utter confidence is engendered at the
            <lb /><orgName corresp="welte.studios">Welte-Mignon Studios</orgName>. You
            instinctively know
            <lb />that your <hi rendition="#u">continued</hi> patronage is sought and, therefore,
            <lb />that
            everything will be made to bend toward
            <lb />giving you thorough and complete
            <lb />satisfaction.
            There is a wide range of
            <lb />instruments from which to choose, at
            <lb />prices and on
            terms thoroughly in
            <lb />accord with your own idea of what is
            <lb />equitable.</ab></div>
            <div facs="#eSc_textblock_6dcfb305">
            <head><hi rendition="#c #b #u #in">
            <lb />The <hi rendition="#uc">Welte-Mignon</hi>
            <lb />Reproducing Piano
            </hi></head>
            <ab><lb />The instrument chosen by
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724">Paderewski</persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/124379923">Lhe-<lb/>vinne</persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/11918625X">
                <sic>Hofman</sic>
            </persName>,
            <persName type="artist" corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118518011">Busoni</persName>
            and scores of others, to
            <lb />
            <seg xml:id="topic_1" ana="#immortality" resp="#np" type="topic">
                preserve their genius for posterity.
            </seg>
            <hi rendition="#smaller">
            <lb />You should hear <persName corresp="https://d-nb.info/gnd/118986724" type="artist">Paderewski's</persName> reproductions;
            <seg xml:id="topic_2" ana="#soulfulness" resp="#np" type="topic">
                hear how
                <lb />he has played
                his soul into indestructible records for the
                <lb /><name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>
            </seg>.
            <seg xml:id="topic_3" ana="#repeatability" resp="#np" type="topic">
                Records which you may
                reproduce at any
                <lb />time and as often as you like
            </seg>, in your own home.
            <lb />
            <num type="cardinal" subtype="artist-count" value="156">
               One hundred and fifty-six
            </num>
            musicians have recorded more
            <lb />than
            <num type="cardinal" subtype="work-count" value="5000">
               five thousand
            </num>
            selections for the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon</name>. Imagine
            <lb />the delight to be derived from such a collection.
            <seg xml:id="topic_4" ana="#affordability" resp="#np" type="topic">
                And con-
                <lb />sider that the <name type="brand">Welte-Mignon Reproducing Piano</name> is within
                <lb />everyone's means, for it may be
                bought on your terms, with-
                <lb />in reason.
            </seg>
            <lb />Just drop in at the <orgName>Studios</orgName> to hear the
            <name type="brand">Welte</name> play. Please
            <lb />feel free to ask for your favorite selections. We consider the
            <lb />pleasure
            entirely ours.
            </hi></ab>
        </div>

        <div facs="#eSc_textblock_8162a045" type="illustration">
            <ab><seg xml:id="topic_5" ana="#sitting_woman" resp="#np" type="topic">
                <figure>
                    <desc resp="#np">
                        Woman sitting in a chair in front of an
                        upright piano.
                    </desc>
                </figure>
                </seg></ab>
        </div>
        <div facs="#zone_terms">
            <ab><lb /><hi rendition="#c #b #larger">WELTE TERMS:</hi>
            <hi rendition="#i #b">
            <lb />We maintain that if music is to be enjoyed by every-
            <lb />one, it must be within everyone's reach. So we placed every
            <lb />instrument in the Studios just there–within EVERYONE'S
            <lb />means. Pick out any instrument you like, from lowest to
            <lb />highest in price, and buy it on YOUR OWN TERMS,
            <lb />within reason.
            </hi></ab>
        </div>

        <gap reason="irrelevant">
            <desc resp="#np">
                The ad also includes textes for "Pathe",
                "Pianos and Player-Pianos" and
                "Victor Victrolas and Victor Records" which
                have been omitted here.
            </desc>
        </gap>
